<view class="page">
  <view class="hero">
    <text class="eyebrow">FITNESS · 个人数据管理</text>
    <text class="title">查看、导出、更正或删除</text>
    <text class="subtitle">导出快照只保存在本页内存；不会写入小程序键值存储或云端文件。</text>
  </view>

  <view class="card" aria-label="个人数据摘要">
    <view class="section-heading">
      <text class="section-title">数据摘要</text>
      <button size="mini" disabled="{{loading || exporting || deleting}}" bindtap="onRefreshSummary">刷新</button>
    </view>
    <text wx:if="{{loading}}">正在读取摘要…</text>
    <block wx:elif="{{summary}}">
      <text>数据状态：{{summary.dataExists ? '存在数据' : '没有数据'}}</text>
      <text>删除状态：{{summary.deletionStatus === 'pending' ? '删除处理中' : '未申请删除'}}</text>
      <text>容量状态：{{summary.capacityStatus === 'within_limit' ? '可自助处理' : '需要人工协助'}}</text>
      <text>版本数：档案 {{summary.counts.bodyProfileVersions}}，目标 {{summary.counts.goalVersions}}，训练 {{summary.counts.trainingPlanVersions}}，餐单 {{summary.counts.mealPlanVersions}}</text>
      <text>其他记录：每日目标 {{summary.counts.dailyTargetVersions}}，照片确认 {{summary.counts.ingredientPhotoRecords}}，助手消息 {{summary.counts.assistantMessages}}</text>
    </block>
  </view>

  <view class="card">
    <text class="section-title">复制或导出</text>
    <text>导出包含结构化记录、内容来源与可追溯的策略/审核数据版本；不会包含身份主键、私有文件 ID 或幂等内部字段。</text>
    <button class="button button--primary" loading="{{exporting}}" disabled="{{loading || exporting || deleting || !summary.dataExists}}" bindtap="onCopyExport">复制严格 JSON</button>
    <button class="button button--secondary" loading="{{exporting}}" disabled="{{loading || exporting || deleting || !summary.dataExists}}" bindtap="onShareExport">生成临时 JSON 并分享</button>
  </view>

  <view class="card">
    <text class="section-title">更正个人数据</text>
    <text>更正会创建新版本，不改写历史事实。请前往结构化规划页面更新身体档案、目标或训练安排。</text>
    <button class="button button--secondary" disabled="{{deleting}}" bindtap="onOpenCorrection">前往版本化更正</button>
  </view>

  <view class="card danger">
    <text class="section-title danger__title">永久删除账户</text>
    <text class="danger__warning">此操作不可撤销。服务端规划、餐单、助手摘要、照片记录和私有原图会被删除；成功后本地恢复数据也会全部清除。</text>
    <label class="field">
      <text>第一步：完整输入“删除我的账户”</text>
      <input value="{{chineseConfirmation}}" disabled="{{deleting}}" bindinput="onChineseConfirmationInput" placeholder="删除我的账户" />
    </label>
    <label class="field">
      <text>第二步：完整输入“DELETE_MY_ACCOUNT”</text>
      <input value="{{technicalConfirmation}}" disabled="{{deleting}}" bindinput="onTechnicalConfirmationInput" placeholder="DELETE_MY_ACCOUNT" />
    </label>
    <button class="button button--danger" loading="{{deleting}}" disabled="{{!canDelete || deleting || loading}}" bindtap="onDeleteAccount">永久删除账户</button>
  </view>

  <view wx:if="{{statusMessage}}" class="notice notice--success" aria-live="polite">{{statusMessage}}</view>
  <view wx:if="{{errorMessage}}" class="notice notice--error" aria-role="alert" aria-live="assertive">{{errorMessage}}</view>

  <button class="privacy-link" disabled="{{deleting}}" bindtap="onOpenPrivacy">查看隐私说明</button>
</view>
